THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Forge redistributes no third-party executables or shared libraries. GPU
rendering goes through Apple's Metal framework, which is part of the operating
system. The application binary does statically embed third-party code, and this
section itemises it: four font files, and C libraries compiled from source.

Fonts
-----

Four fonts are compiled into the binary by way of the `epaint_default_fonts`
crate, which egui's default font set draws on. They remain the fallback for any
character the system fonts do not cover, so they ship whether or not they are
the fonts you see.

